# Agent instructions

This repository contains one Agent Skill: `skills/anti-slop-studio/`.

If your agent supports Agent Skills (SKILL.md), install the skill folder (see README) and it will load on its own when a task matches its description.

If your agent does not support skills, read `skills/anti-slop-studio/SKILL.md` before doing creative work such as scripts, ad copy, captions, reels, promo videos, motion graphics, UI or Hinglish copy. Follow its workflow: lock the direction first, produce with the matching file in `skills/anti-slop-studio/references/`, then run the scanners in `skills/anti-slop-studio/scripts/` and fix what they flag.

Do not edit the files in `skills/` unless asked.
